      <description>Americans Amber Glenn, Alysa Liu and Isabeau took to the ice to skate in the short program. The women have become known as Team USA’s “Blade Angels”. Men’s figure skater Ilia Malinin opened up to NBC News’ Stephanie Gosk about the pressure at the Olympics and his disappointment at finishing in eighth place.</description>
